  "ai_sections": [
    {
      "section_id": "entity_coverage",
      "block_id": "client_profile",
      "label": "Client Profile (AI-generated \u2014 click Generate, then edit)",
      "type": "paragraphs",
      "output_schema": "text",
      "editable": true,
      "grounding": true,
      "prompt": "You are preparing the \"Entity Coverage\" summary for a proposal on the Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023 (DPDP Act) Impact Assessment & Compliance.\n\nClient organisation: {{ client.name }}{% if client.website %} (website: {{ client.website }}){% endif %}\n{% if client.profile %}Additional user-provided context about the organisation:\n{{ client.profile }}\n\n{% endif %}Entities/subsidiaries covered: {{ computed.entities_phrase }}\nIndustry / sectors of the organisation: {{ ai.industries_phrase }}\n\nUse publicly available knowledge of this organisation where possible (its sector, programs, beneficiary base, donors/clients, technology and data-sharing ecosystem), informed by the sectors above. Write a short, professional 2-paragraph (90-140 words) summary of how personal data is present within these entities and how DPDP would assess that data. Return ONLY the summary text \u2014 no headings, no bullets, no preamble, no markdown.\n",
      "requires": [
        "ai",
        "ai.industries_phrase",
        "client",
        "client.name",
        "client.profile",
        "client.website",
        "computed",
        "computed.entities_phrase"
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "data_categories",
      "block_id": "categories",
      "label": "Data Categories (AI-generated \u2014 click Generate, then edit)",
      "type": "categories",
      "output_schema": "categories",
      "editable": true,
      "grounding": true,
      "prompt": "For the organisation \"{{ client.name }}\" (entities/subsidiaries: {{ computed.entities_phrase }}){% if client.website %}, website: {{ client.website }}{% endif %}\n\nIndustry / sectors of the organisation: {{ ai.industries_phrase }}\n\nList the personal-data categories it is likely to process under India's DPDP Act 2023, inferred from its business, website and entity ecosystem, with reference to the sectors above. Base the list on real knowledge of the organisation where available.\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON (no markdown, no explanation) as an array of 5-9 objects, each with exactly: \"id\" (short slug), \"title\" (short category name), \"summary\" (one sentence, max 30 words), \"bullets\" (3-6 short bullet strings). Keep category names concise.\n",
      "requires": [
        "ai",
        "ai.industries_phrase",
        "client",
        "client.name",
        "client.website",
        "computed",
        "computed.entities_phrase"
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "data_processing_characteristics",
      "block_id": "processing_bullets",
      "label": null,
      "type": "bullets",
      "output_schema": "bullets",
      "editable": false,
      "grounding": false,
      "prompt": "You are preparing the \"Data Processing Characteristics under DPDPA\" section of a DPDP (Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023) Impact Assessment proposal.\n\nClient: {{ client.name }}\nEntities covered: {{ computed.entities_phrase }}\nIndustry / sectors of the organisation: {{ ai.industries_phrase }}\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON (no markdown, no explanation) as an array of 6-10 strings. Each string is one bullet describing how and why personal data is processed, starting from the sources it is collected from (collection, use, sharing, storage, retention, security, third parties, cross-location, etc.) in the context of DPDP obligations. Be concise (max 35 words each) and formal. The JSON must be well-formed.\n",
      "requires": [
        "ai",
        "ai.industries_phrase",
        "client",
        "client.name",
        "computed",
        "computed.entities_phrase"
      ]
    }
  ]
}